{"version":"2026.10.11-r25","id":"Q155685","formula":"C₂₈H₄₆O","hill":"C28H46O","elements":["H","C","O"],"composition":{"C":28.0,"H":46.0,"O":1.0},"names":{"en":"Dihydrotachysterol","ru":"Дигидротахистерол"},"descriptions":{"en":"Dihydrotachysterol (DHT) is a synthetic vitamin D analog activated in the liver that does not require renal hydroxylation like vitamin D2 (ergocalciferol) and vitamin D3 (cholecalciferol). DHT has a rapid onset of action (2 hours), a shorter half-life, and a greater effect on mineralization of bone salts than does vitamin D. DHT is a derivative of tachysterol. Tachysterol is a reaction side product in the light-dependent natural production of vitamin Ds.","ru":"Дигидротахистерол — лекарственное средство. По химическому строению и механизму действия близок к витамину D2, является провитамином D3 (аналог 1,25(OH)2D), по эффективности аналогичен кальцитриолу (отличие только во времени наступления эффекта). Дигидротахистерол является регулятором обмена фосфора и кальция, абсорбируется в тонком кишечнике."},"fame":14,"pubchemCid":5311071,"mass":398.7,"charge":0,"smiles":"C[C@H]\\1CC[C@@H](C/C1=C\\C=C\\2/CCC[C@]3([C@H]2CC[C@@H]3[C@H](C)/C=C/[C@H](C)C(C)C)C)O","inchikey":"ILYCWAKSDCYMBB-OPCMSESCSA-N","iupac":"trans-(1S,3E,4S)-3-[(2E)-2-[(1R,3aS,7aR)-1-[(E,2R,5R)-5,6-dimethylhept-3-en-2-yl]-7a-methyl-2,3,3a,5,6,7-hexahydro-1H-inden-4-ylidene]ethylidene]-4-methylcyclohexan-1-ol","classes":[{"qid":"Q113145171","names":{"en":"type of chemical entity","ru":"тип химического объекта","uk":"тип хімічної сутності"}}],"structureInfo":{"kind":"molecule","source":"pubchem","ref":"5311071","atoms":75,"license":"PubChem (NIH), public data"},"structure":{"kind":"molecule","atoms":[{"x":4.591,"y":2.384,"z":1.713,"el":"O"},{"x":-0.697,"y":-1.333,"z":0.143,"el":"C"},{"x":-2.062,"y":-0.881,"z":-0.431,"el":"C"},{"x":0.23,"y":-0.869,"z":-1.007,"el":"C"},{"x":-1.766,"y":0.504,"z":-1.05,"el":"C"},{"x":-0.245,"y":0.558,"z":-1.287,"el":"C"},{"x":-0.549,"y":-2.86,"z":0.303